<% page_title "Music you are cleared to publish" %>
<% page_description "Subscribe to a genre, download full-length 48 kHz masters, and keep a dated licence record for every file. AI Pop Music licenses AI-generated songs for commercial work." %>

<section class="wrap pt-10" data-controller="reveal">
  <p class="meta" data-reveal>Licensed catalogue · <%= @genres.size %> genres published</p>

  <h1 class="display-1 mt-6 max-w-[18ch]" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 60ms">
    Music you are cleared to publish.
  </h1>

  <p class="lede mt-6" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">
    Subscribe to the genres you work in. Download full-length 48 kHz masters, not loops.
    Every download records the licence version it was granted under, so when a platform asks
    where your soundtrack came from, you have the answer.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 180ms">
    <%= link_to "Choose your genres", plans_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
    <%= link_to "Hear the catalogue", genres_path, class: "btn" %>
    <span class="meta">From $5 a month · cancel any time</span>
  </div>
</section>

<% if @genres.any? %>
  <section class="mt-16 border-y border-ink-800 py-5" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="marquee">
      <div class="marquee-track gap-10">
        <% 2.times do %>
          <% @genres.each do |genre| %>
            <span class="font-display text-3xl text-ink-400 whitespace-nowrap"><%= genre.name %></span>
            <span class="text-accent">◆</span>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
<% end %>

<% if @recent_tracks.any? %>
  <section class="wrap mt-16" data-controller="reveal">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <h2 class="display-2">Press play</h2>
        <p class="lede mt-3 text-base">
          The catalogue, playable right here. Previews are free and need no account.
        </p>
      </div>
      <%= link_to "All genres", genres_path, class: "btn text-sm" %>
    </div>

    <ul class="mt-8 border-t border-ink-800" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
      <% @recent_tracks.each do |track| %>
        <%= render "tracks/track_row", track: track,
          entitled: (current_member ? current_member.can_download?(track) : false) %>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  </section>
<% end %>

<section class="wrap mt-20" data-controller="reveal">
  <h2 class="display-2" data-reveal>The part that usually goes wrong</h2>

  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <div data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0ms">
      <p class="meta">Vague licences</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-paper-dim">
        "Royalty-free" usually means a licence you cannot check and no paperwork when a claim
        lands months later. You end up choosing between music you cannot prove you may use and
        music everyone has already heard.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
      <p class="meta">Snippets, not songs</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-paper-dim">
        Loops and 30-second beds fade out mid-sentence. Scoring anything longer than a reel
        means stitching the same four bars together.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
      <p class="meta">No provenance</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-paper-dim">
        You cannot tell where the file came from, who else has it, or what model made it -
        so you cannot answer a question about it later.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap mt-20" data-controller="reveal">
  <h2 class="display-2" data-reveal>What you get instead</h2>

  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="surface surface-hover p-6" data-reveal>
      <p class="meta">A licence you can produce</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-paper-dim">
        Every download writes a record against your account: which track, which terms, which
        day. It is the difference between "I think I am allowed to use this" and a dated entry
        you can send to a platform.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="surface surface-hover p-6" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
      <p class="meta">Songs, not snippets</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-paper-dim">
        Full-length 48 kHz stereo masters you can score a whole piece with - edit, loop and mix
        them into your work.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="surface surface-hover p-6" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
      <p class="meta">Music that fits the edit</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-paper-dim">
        Tempo, key, duration and mood sit on every track, so you match the cut instead of
        auditioning blindly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap mt-20" data-controller="reveal">
  <h2 class="display-2" data-reveal>How it works</h2>

  <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <% [ [ "Pick a plan and your genres", "A plan covers a number of genres. Change which ones whenever you like; the price stays the same." ],
         [ "Download what you need", "Preview anything without an account. Subscribe and the masters unlock, with the licence recorded as you take them." ],
         [ "Publish and keep the record", "Use the tracks in videos, podcasts, streams, games and client work. Your download history stays as the proof." ] ].each_with_index do |(title, body), index| %>
      <li class="surface p-6" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: <%= index * 80 %>ms">
        <p class="meta">0<%= index + 1 %></p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-display text-xl"><%= title %></p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-paper-dim"><%= body %></p>
      </li>
    <% end %>
  </ol>
</section>

<% if @genres.any? %>
  <section class="wrap mt-20" data-controller="reveal">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="display-2">Start with a genre</h2>
      <%= link_to "All genres", genres_path, class: "btn text-sm" %>
    </div>

    <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <% @genres.each_with_index do |genre, index| %>
        <li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: <%= (index % 3) * 70 %>ms">
          <%= link_to genre_path(genre), class: "surface surface-hover flex h-full flex-col p-6" do %>
            <p class="font-display text-2xl"><%= genre.name %></p>
            <p class="meta-plain mt-2"><%= pluralize(genre.track_count, "track") %></p>
            <% if genre.description.present? %>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-paper-dim"><%= genre.description %></p>
            <% end %>
            <span class="meta mt-auto pt-6 text-accent">Open genre →</span>
          <% end %>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  </section>
<% end %>

<% faqs = {
  "Can I really use these tracks commercially?" =>
    "Yes. An active subscription licenses every track in the genres your plan covers for commercial use, " \
    "including monetised videos, podcasts, client work and games. The licence page lists exactly what is " \
    "granted and what is not.",
  "What happens if a platform flags my video?" =>
    "Send us the order or download record and we will confirm the licence. Your account keeps a dated entry " \
    "for every file you have taken, which is the point of recording it at download time.",
  "What if I cancel?" =>
    "Downloads stop straight away and your genres stop being available. Work you already published stays " \
    "licensed under the terms in force when you downloaded it, so a released project is not put at risk.",
  "Is this music unique to me?" =>
    "Every track is generated from a recorded prompt and seed, and that provenance is stored with the track. " \
    "We do not resell the same master as a stock library item, so you are not competing with a hundred other " \
    "channels using the identical file.",
  "Do I need to credit you?" =>
    "No. Attribution is welcome and is never a condition of the licence."
} %>

<section class="wrap mt-20" data-controller="reveal">
  <h2 class="display-2" data-reveal>Questions that decide it</h2>

  <dl class="measure mt-8 border-t border-ink-800" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 60ms">
    <% faqs.each do |question, answer| %>
      <div class="border-b border-ink-800 py-5">
        <dt class="font-display text-lg"><%= question %></dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm text-paper-dim"><%= answer %></dd>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </dl>
</section>

<%= structured_data(faq_structured_data(faqs)) %>

<section class="wrap mt-20">
  <div class="surface flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 p-8">
    <div>
      <h2 class="display-2">Find your genre</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-paper-dim">
        From $5 a month. Preview everything first - listening needs no account.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <%= link_to "Choose your genres", plans_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
      <%= link_to "Browse by genre", genres_path, class: "btn" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
